{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-36","kind":"proposition","title":"等底同高平行四边形面积相等","englishTitle":"Parallelograms which are on equal bases and in the same parallels are equal to one another.","book":1,"number":36,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":36,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","contentId":"euclid-1-36","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25dcd07ecf1f925c35f7351470fdc50c4e05e6c8bb590783fe3126e7526fc838","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-36.statement","euclid-1-36.construction.1","euclid-1-36.construction.2","euclid-1-36.proof.1","euclid-1-36.proof.2","euclid-1-36.proof.3","euclid-1-36.proof.4","euclid-1-36.proof.5","euclid-1-36.proof.6","euclid-1-36.conclusion","euclid-1-36.historical.1","euclid-1-36.historical.2","euclid-1-36.historical.3","euclid-1-36.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-36.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83bd47b6f72ed335e1e1991f30a8511df46dd7cc87f7016fb5015fbb7fe916df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Parallelograms which are on equal bases and in the same parallels are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行四边形的相同时间为底边, 并同时处于相同时间。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有两平行方形若底等则形亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平行四边形在两个平行四边形之内，则它们的底边相等，那么它们的形状也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9b6a860b63f8a907d7e771d308f17f342abf3350e5da526325a0a40db7c7346","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD, EFGH be parallelograms which are on equal bases BC, FG and in the same parallels AH, BG; I say that the parallelogram ABCD is equal to EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD,EFGH,平行四边形,平行四边形,底边,,FG,并同时,AH,BG;我说,平行四边形,ABCD等于EFGH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68c2365a8b92e47598119974c3b27fd93931f0ea81fb80fb720cd19e100ebcfa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BE, CH be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BE,CH连接进来"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf3f7960378f04e94b50af3ecba4aefc5c5a61179b3717f672dd664fb3bb709c","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since BC is equal to FG while FG is equal to EH, BC is also equal to EH. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"礛由于BC等于FG,而FG等于EH,BC也等于EH。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7446f3b29da1f47e9ae0f916994de498ca4a8e5976b24578fac7ab556fca8fe3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they are also parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它们也是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0444d24b4ea8e01feaec452fb180a15cbea75b45d08f18ff41351e0a350bc4b9","citations":["euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EB, HC join them; but straight lines joining equal and parallel straight lines (at the extremities which are) in the same directions (respectively) are equal and parallel. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EB,HC线类的接合,但齐线的接合,是相同方向的平行线。 [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84ad26a40b1893a3b8970537d1fb723f88b9028265ca4cfd356c1b537fdd2ea1","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EBCH is a parallelogram. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以EBCH是平行四边形 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9583b0cc8e23110e6fd2936ac049a0dbf3eca6582b55b09321357320b7986358","citations":["euclid-1-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is equal to ABCD; for it has the same base BC with it, and is in the same parallels BC, AH with it. [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于ABCD;因为它与它具有相同的底边 BC, 与它具有相同的BC, AH。 [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5b9e0e66f8aa5ed67e282f0944e6342e001929a560f067ec885166461b651db","citations":["euclid-1-35","euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also EFGH is equal to the same EBCH; [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)] so that the parallelogram ABCD is also equal to EFGH. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,EFGH等于EBCH;因此,平行四边形等于EFGH。（相关点与线段：ABCD） [[I. 35](/principles/euclid-1-35)] [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"796e7fc15890a39d15e924009e7f8dc44d69044a49aec88bc5e2dbd5402f3213","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有两平行方形若底等则形亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平行四边形在两个平行四边形之内，则它们的底边相等，那么它们的形状也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db22319e2208aac90323f6ee54b0f5bc3d04e51a68e04b663e3748869de5cbb5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两平行线内有甲丙戊己与庚辛丁乙两平行方形而丙戊与辛丁两底等题言两形亦等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：在两条平行线 甲乙丙丁 之间，有平行四边形 甲丙戊己 和 庚辛丁乙，而 丙戊 和 辛丁 有底边，命题解释这两个形状也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb140bb5eca66ae3788c54e80a3c4f841979c8cd156a6363df3f98e252c9f94e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试自丙至庚戊至乙各作直线相联其丙戊庚乙各与辛丁等则丙戊与庚乙亦等〈本篇卅四〉庚乙与丙戊既平行线则庚丙与乙戊亦平行线〈本篇卅三〉而甲丙戊己与庚丙戊乙两平行方形同丙戊底者等矣〈本篇三五〉庚辛丁乙与庚丙戊乙两平行方形同庚乙底者亦等矣〈本篇三五〉既尔则庚辛丁乙与甲丙戊己亦等〈公论一〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：从 丙 到 庚戊 再到 乙 画直线，并将它们连接成直线。如果 丙戊庚乙 等于 辛丁，那么 丙戊 和 庚乙 也相等 〈本篇卅四〉庚乙，并且由于它们与 丙戊 平行，那么 庚丙 和 乙戊 也是平行线。〈本篇卅三〉 和 甲丙戊己 以及 庚丙戊乙 是以 丙戊 为底的平行四边形 〈本篇三五〉庚辛丁乙 和 庚丙戊乙 是以 庚乙 为底的平行四边形。〈本篇三五〉 也等于 庚辛丁乙 和 甲丙戊己。〈公论一〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-36.source","contentId":"euclid-1-36","revisionId":"euclid-1-36@raw-25dcd07ecf1f925c","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12345d4f1bee9588fe5a33fc9ffb7d7adeeb23b4a2aa4d50474158ef94094157","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-36:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-36.proof.1","euclid-1-36.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-cn-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36/","sourceLabel":"C.N. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-36:euclid-1-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-36.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.36/","sourceLabel":"I. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-36:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-36